Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,-- Usagi Drop 02 --
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.47,0:00:04.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Futon, clothes, shoes, toothbrush.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.56,0:00:07.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.02,0:00:08.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.57,0:00:14.82,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, don't just leave my side like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.82,0:00:16.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You scared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.53,0:00:17.83,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.58,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, get me a green one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.80,0:00:36.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Alright, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:44.56,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's dangerous if we don't hold hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.48,0:00:48.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Dangerous for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(591,287)}Presented by:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:19.86,Presented By,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(165,0)\blur0.4\pos(775,287)}Taka Fansubs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.30,0:02:47.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Were there always this many parents and children here?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.27,0:02:49.31,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.27,0:02:55.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:56.19,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.19,0:03:00.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, okay. Looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:02.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What size are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.41,0:03:03.74,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.83,0:03:10.21,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Where should I measure it from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.46,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.46,0:03:19.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Stop flapping!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.76,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:26.22,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Pajamas, underwear, shirts, socks!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.65,0:03:36.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you want some skirts too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.27,0:03:38.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,These are all pants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.15,0:03:41.15,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They don't allow skirts at the daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:43.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:50.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Daycare?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:52.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I completely forgot!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Tomorrow's Monday!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:01.76,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.76,0:04:05.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just hang on, we're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.05,0:04:06.43,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:09.10,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:12.39,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.39,0:04:14.04,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.67,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Could you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.46,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, Maeda residence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:45.13,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm so sorry to hear about your family's loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.64,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.64,0:04:50.89,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, it's Daikichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.89,0:04:54.48,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, okay. Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.94,0:04:57.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.73,0:05:00.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I didn't have your cell phone number.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.02,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:04.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, how do I enter a kid into a daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:07.45,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:11.41,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,So you really did take Rin-chan home?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.41,0:05:14.37,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Are things okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.37,0:05:16.33,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,For the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.75,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.75,0:05:22.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The thing is, I can't take tomorrow off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.50,0:05:24.30,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's the proper protocol here?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:27.63,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, daycares don't just let kids in that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.63,0:05:29.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Couldn't you do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.26,0:05:31.26,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure what I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:34.56,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I guess for now you could ask at city hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.56,0:05:36.35,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's Sunday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.44,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, it's on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:41.27,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:44.82,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Stop it, Reina! This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.27,0:05:40.81,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama, is that Rin-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.81,0:05:42.36,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.57,0:05:44.82,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.82,0:05:48.07,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,There's an emergency short-term daycare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.07,0:05:50.41,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,An emergency short-term daycare?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.32,0:05:50.41,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.41,0:05:52.08,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:54.49,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Dai-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:56.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing, it's on my end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.99,0:05:56.79,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan! Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.79,0:05:59.42,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Just hold on, I'm almost done!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.42,0:06:00.58,Main,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,I'm tired of waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.58,0:06:03.00,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Haruko-san, the miso soup is about done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.00,0:06:04.63,Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.63,0:06:08.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It sounds like you're busy. I'll call later {\fscx250}- {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.09,0:06:09.30,Overlap,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:13.10,Osu,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.7\pos(553,54)}Osu City Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:13.10,Typing,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(892,256)}Emergency Short-term
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.59,0:06:13.10,Typing,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(1050,214)}Daycare
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:13.10,Sports,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.8\pos(479,274)}Sports Day for Parents and Kids
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.30,0:06:13.10,Site,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur1\pos(1057,372)}City Hall Site Map
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:17.23,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Man, there's so few of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.23,0:06:19.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My commuting time just doubled.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.52,0:06:24.19,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.19,0:06:28.65,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This one's not too far, but I can't leave the office at six.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:28.65,Overlap,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's play again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.65,0:06:31.62,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay. Bye-bye, Reina-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.62,0:06:32.95,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.29,0:06:40.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This one looks good, but it only\Nprovides emergency care for ten days.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.87,0:06:42.71,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.67,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:06.98,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.98,0:07:09.44,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.78,0:07:13.45,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.91,0:07:23.13,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you sleep here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.79,0:07:27.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why's it so warm here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.76,0:07:30.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Take this off!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:35.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:41.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So about the daycare we're going to today...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.19,0:07:51.32,Main,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for this meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.86,0:07:57.12,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't have your elbow on the table when you eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:59.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.38,0:08:09.50,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen, the daycare we're going to today is only a temporary one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.50,0:08:10.34,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Temporary?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.34,0:08:14.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It means you'll be there until we find a place that'll let you officially enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:16.28,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's "officially" mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:25.77,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Like properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.77,0:08:27.73,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, that's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.11,0:08:31.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My hair's fine! {she's touching his hair}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.66,0:08:37.87,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.16,0:08:41.37,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:53.80,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.80,0:08:55.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.85,0:09:00.93,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:04.48,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down! Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.48,0:09:07.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.44,0:09:10.94,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Embarrassed that the other kids might see me carrying you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What the...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.82,0:09:22.01,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.91,0:09:24.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:32.84,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave her with you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:35.42,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, see you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:10:00.53,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with that face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.53,0:10:02.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say I'll be back before it gets dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.83,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I'll get here as fast as I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.66,0:10:07.04,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.25,0:10:13.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I pinky promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.34,0:10:18.38,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If I lie, I'll swallow a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:19.97,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Damn those needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:22.05,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky break!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.76,0:10:24.97,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,That's not the right song.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:29.52,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm off. Wait for me, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:36.36,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sorry, Rin.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.36,0:10:40.66,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I didn't realize how you were feeling.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.66,0:10:48.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Your mom's disappearance and Grandpa's death had nothing to do with you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.10,0:10:53.34,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}And yet you're the only one left to face that lonely reality.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.34,0:10:57.09,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,400)}{\i1}Did you think I was going to leave you behind as well?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.51,0:11:00.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'm sorry.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.51,0:11:02.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}That won't happen ever again.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.90,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Can you read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.15,0:11:17.40,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.63,0:11:39.67,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, wanna grab a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.67,0:11:42.55,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I brought my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:44.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I have to leave a little early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.18,0:11:48.68,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really? Alright then, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:51.02,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,You're going all out, right from the start of the month, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.27,0:11:54.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:09.42,MainLow,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Take a picture of this sample.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.42,0:12:10.08,MainLow,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.08,0:12:14.22,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, there's a caller on line four asking about the private audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.22,0:12:15.49,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,On my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.29,0:12:18.59,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:31.06,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.06,0:12:32.73,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:34.06,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.52,0:12:37.90,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let's keep going!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.90,0:12:39.02,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:48.41,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.41,0:12:50.70,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.21,0:12:57.04,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,You're late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:59.17,Main,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, sorry. Go change.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.17,0:13:00.46,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.55,0:13:08.34,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, don't bring it down, okay? {talking about the wood thing they built}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.34,0:13:09.18,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:10.47,Main,Kid,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.35,0:13:14.73,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.36,0:13:28.45,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, please wait a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:29.37,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:32.66,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,It's Miyata-san from Mitsutomo Commerce.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:36.62,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Transfer him to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:38.92,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.92,0:13:40.54,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We appreciate your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.27,0:13:57.02,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Kawachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.02,0:14:00.15,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.15,0:14:04.07,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll be able to leave in just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:05.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:50.57,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This daycare is so far!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:04.79,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, sorry I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.76,0:15:12.43,Main,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:15.26,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.35,0:15:17.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.48,0:15:29.40,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa, potatoes! They look delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:31.32,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They're chopped vegetables!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.16,0:15:38.91,Dai,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(725,446)}Daikichi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.79,0:15:44.88,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I swallowed...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.67,0:15:50.01,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,a thousand needles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.87,0:16:22.46,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.83,0:16:26.88,Main,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, I need you to sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.20,0:17:02.29,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I may just be a worrywart,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:05.00,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but what should I do if I get a girlfriend?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.05,0:17:16.26,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.05,0:17:18.68,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.10,0:17:22.81,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.81,0:17:27.27,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi, you shipped this out yesterday, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:31.44,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.44,0:17:34.32,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,It's unusual for you to mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.32,0:17:35.90,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.90,0:17:38.41,Main,Boss,0000,0000,0000,,I already apologized to the customer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:40.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'll call them too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.66,0:17:47.33,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go for a drink later. It has been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.33,0:17:49.63,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I can't tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.63,0:17:51.88,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,How about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.88,0:17:53.80,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Tomorrow's no good, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.47,0:17:59.80,Main,Mura,0000,0000,0000,,I get it. Way to go. {probably thinks he has a girlfriend}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.74,0:18:22.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Climb on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.37,0:18:26.20,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.05,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.05,0:18:42.43,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You better hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:01.61,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, don't let the moon catch us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:05.95,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:36.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This'll never end!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.45,0:19:45.16,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}How long can I continue living like this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.29,0:20:32.41,Handbook,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(481,70)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.41,0:20:32.54,Handbook2,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(529,90)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.54,0:20:36.96,Handbook3,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.4\pos(582,106)}Maternity and Child\NCare Handbook
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.96,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(757,403)}Kaga Souichi
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.96,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(767,426)}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.66,0:20:36.96,Names,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur0.3\pos(767,468)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:56.67,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}These are Rin-chan's.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.67,0:20:01.59,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The child care handbook and important documents are all she has.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.47,0:20:08.51,Main,Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}It might only be for a short time,\Nbut raising a child is very difficult.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.51,0:20:12.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Isn't it Rin who's got the worst end?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.48,0:20:16.98,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sorry, but I'm just going to look for a second.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.69,0:20:23.86,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Her mouth hasn't changed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.91,0:20:31.91,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The rest of my family speak as if you were a villain or something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.91,0:20:36.96,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What's the true story, Masako-san?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.10,0:22:16.18,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:18.10,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:21.48,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,By the way, when did you start sleeping on that side?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.45,0:22:31.24,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Was that me?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.66,0:22:36.08,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.59,0:22:47.51,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay, fine. It's sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.51,0:22:49.47,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Help me remove the sheets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.47,0:22:51.47,Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I said it's sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.47,0:22:54.06,Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm saying it's sweat too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:22:56.09,Main,,0000,0000,0000,,
